#: ../../source/intro.rst:2
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "简介"

#: ../../source/intro.rst:6
msgid "Background"
msgstr "背景"

#: ../../source/intro.rst:8
msgid ""
"PartCAD was initially just an internal library in the `OpenVMP project "
"<https://github.com/openvmp/openvmp>`_ to maintain the blueprints of "
"OpenVMP robots in a way that allows reconfiguring the blueprints based on"
" the specific needs (parameters), and allows to maintain the bill of "
"materials and all the necessary data to purchase the required parts."
msgstr "PartCAD 最初只是 `OpenVMP 项目 <https://github.com/openvmp/openvmp>`_ 中的一个内部库，用于维护 OpenVMP 机器人的设计蓝图，使其能够根据具体需求（参数）重新配置蓝图，并维护物料清单以及采购所需零件所需的全部数据。"

#: ../../source/intro.rst:14
msgid ""
"The OpenVMP project has surfaced the need for an open source Product "
"Lifecycle Management (PLM) system that would use Git for collaboration on"
" the designs themselves, the supplementary documentation and supplier "
"information (and integration). To address that need PartCAD was published"
" as a standalone framework to be used by any project."
msgstr "OpenVMP 项目凸显出对一套开源产品生命周期管理（PLM）系统的需求，该系统会使用 Git 来协作完成设计本身、辅助文档以及供应商信息（及其集成）。为满足这一需求，PartCAD 作为一个可供任何项目使用的独立框架发布。"

#: ../../source/intro.rst:23
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/intro.rst:25
msgid "PartCAD can be perceived as consisting of four parts:"
msgstr "PartCAD 可以看作由以下四个部分组成："

#: ../../source/intro.rst:27
msgid "PartCAD standards and conventions on how to maintain product information"
msgstr "关于如何维护产品信息的 PartCAD 标准与约定"

#: ../../source/intro.rst:29
msgid ""
"The public repository of products created and maintained by the community"
" based on the PartCAD standards and conventions"
msgstr "由社区依据 PartCAD 标准与约定创建和维护的公共产品仓库"

#: ../../source/intro.rst:32
msgid ""
"Tools that operate with public and private repositories for as long as "
"they are maintained following the PartCAD standards and conventions"
msgstr "只要公共和私有仓库遵循 PartCAD 标准与约定进行维护，即可对其进行操作的工具"

#: ../../source/intro.rst:35
msgid ""
"Libraries and frameworks to programmatically interact with product "
"information in public and private PartCAD repositories"
msgstr "用于以编程方式与公共和私有 PartCAD 仓库中的产品信息进行交互的库和框架"

#: ../../source/intro.rst:38
msgid ""
"Detailed documentation on all of the above can be found in the 'Design' "
"section."
msgstr "关于上述所有内容的详细文档，可在“设计”一节中找到。"
